{
  "meta": {
    "description": "Firms listed by KNF, used to build registry_ads queries (every alias x every template in ad_phrases.yaml) and, with config/m2_sources.yaml, firm_marketing queries. Also the list of registered owners whose own content registry_ads and shadow_advisory drop.",
    "rules": [
      "A brand is listed only when every firm in `registry` exists in a KNF register file in docs/firm_registry; firms absent from KNF are not searched for.",
      "`aliases` come from the KNF pages (legal name without legal form, other/former names, 'nazwa handlowa'); `manual_aliases` are product or marketing names of the same firm (e.g. xStation = XTB platform) added by the team.",
      "All aliases, short ones included, are used in queries. Matching is case- and diacritic-insensitive; `word_boundary_aliases` must match on word boundaries.",
      "`domains` come from the KNF pages and are for matching outbound links.",
      "Brands with `scope: registered_in_poland` complete the module 2 scope (all firms of brokerage_firms / foreign_investment_firms); their `manual_aliases` are short / brand names added by the team, their websites are in m2_sources.yaml."
    ],
    "notes": {
      "Conotoxia / Cinkciarz": "KNF page: licence fully suspended by the Cypriot supervisor since 2025-07-23 — the firm may not provide investment services."
    }
  },
